project61-agentOS-happylegend

This repository uses xv6-riscv as the base teaching operating system for
the Agent-OS functional challenge.

See README.md for project information and docs/xv6-riscv-README for the
original xv6-riscv notes.

Source code is released under Apache License 2.0. Original xv6-riscv
notices are retained in THIRD_PARTY/xv6-riscv-LICENSE.

Project documentation and presentation materials created by this team are
released under CC BY-SA 4.0; see DOCUMENTATION_LICENSE.md.
